#: templates/core/terms.html
msgid "Law and courts"
msgstr "Lei aplicável e foro"

#: templates/core/terms.html
msgid ""
"Swiss law applies. If you are a consumer, you keep the protection of the "
"mandatory law of the country you live in, and you can always take a dispute "
"to the courts where you live. Otherwise the courts at the operator's place "
"of residence in Switzerland decide. Before any of that, please write to us -"
" most things are faster to fix than to argue about."
msgstr ""
"Aplica-se o direito suíço. Se você for consumidor, mantém a proteção da lei "
"imperativa do país onde mora e pode sempre levar uma disputa aos tribunais "
